"""User-requested click-loaded third-party player, distinct from Aethus's host."""
from play_recommendations import recommendations, stylesheet

P = '/azeroth-survivors/'
GAME = 'https://s.the-false-sun.com/azeroth-survivors/index.html'

def play_page(shell, ext):
    body = f'''<nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-play-background><a href="{P}">Azeroth Survivors</a> / Play</nav>
<header class="play-intro" id="guide" data-play-background><p class="play-kicker">HOSTED v0.90.0 · THIRD-PARTY BUILD</p><h1>Play Azeroth Survivors online</h1><p>Load the hosted game here, or open Aethus’s original in its own tab.</p></header>
<section class="game-panel" id="game-panel" aria-label="Azeroth Survivors game window" data-mode="normal"><div class="game-screen" id="game-screen"><div class="game-cover" id="game-cover"><div><span class="play-emblem" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><h2>Azeroth Survivors</h2><p>A hero, a spellbook and a growing horde.</p><button class="play-button" type="button" id="game-launch">Play Azeroth Survivors →</button><p class="cover-note">Click to load the third-party game from s.the-false-sun.com.<br>Its initial world-data preparation can take several minutes.</p><noscript><p>Use one of the direct game links below.</p></noscript></div></div><iframe id="game-frame" title="Azeroth Survivors third-party game hosted by s.the-false-sun.com" data-src="{GAME}" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; gamepad" allowfullscreen sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms allow-pointer-lock allow-orientation-lock" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" hidden></iframe></div>
<div class="game-meta"><p><strong>Third-party browser build.</strong> Separate from wow.aethus.pl. Do not assume the same version, accounts, addons or saves. <a href="#edition">Edition &amp; save details</a>.</p><div class="game-tools"><button id="game-expand" type="button" aria-pressed="false" disabled>Expand game</button><button id="game-minimize" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="game-screen" disabled>Hide game</button>{ext(GAME,'s.the-false-sun.com · open game')}{ext('https://wow.aethus.pl/','Aethus · play original')}</div><p id="game-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Click Play to connect. Pause inside the game before hiding it.</p></div></section>
<div class="game-dock" id="game-dock" hidden><span>Azeroth Survivors hidden</span><button id="game-restore" type="button">Return to game ↑</button></div>
{recommendations('azeroth-survivors')}
<article class="play-notes" data-play-background><nav class="play-jump" aria-label="Play help"><a href="#start">Start &amp; controls</a><a href="#edition">Edition &amp; saves</a><a href="#loading">Loading help</a><a href="#sources">Sources</a></nav>
<section id="start"><h2>Start in the game window</h2><ol><li>Press <strong>Play Azeroth Survivors</strong> above and let the hosted game finish preparing its world data.</li><li>Read the character and zone choices in the game before starting. Our <a href="{P}beginners-guide/">beginner guide</a> and <a href="{P}builds/">class builds</a> cover the original host and name their checked version; this hosted client may differ.</li><li>Click inside the game for keyboard focus. Check the game’s own input settings before relying on a key or controller mapping.</li></ol><p>Expand gives the game more browser space. Hide and Return keep the same frame loaded; they do not pause the game. Pause inside the game first. On small screens, try landscape. Browser-size checks do not establish physical-phone compatibility.</p></section>
<section id="edition"><h2>Keep this edition and your original save separate</h2><p>This window uses the same third-party game address linked by azerothsurvivors.online, checked 31 October 2026.<sup class="ref"><a href="#source-1">[1]</a></sup> We do not host the executable, operate its servers or claim an official partnership. The menu displayed v0.90.0 (ac6aefc3), with nine zones, on this check. The original-game guides checked v0.130.0 separately. Version parity, addon support, account transfer and save compatibility are unverified.</p><p>Our desktop browser startup check on 31 October reached Elwynn Forest’s Jasperlode Mine with a Warrior. Movement started the run; the timer reached 00:06 and the Level 2 card choice appeared. This is a short startup check, not a completed run, multiplayer test, save-transfer test or physical-phone benchmark. Initial resource and world-data preparation took several minutes.</p><p>The original Aethus game at wow.aethus.pl blocks third-party frames, so its direct link opens a separate tab.<sup class="ref"><a href="#source-2">[2]</a></sup> Keep existing progress at the address and browser profile that created it. Before experimenting with an import, keep an unchanged export from each client; importing is not a way to merge progress. See the <a href="{P}save-backup/">original-game backup guide</a>.</p><p>Loading this game connects your browser to its host and services. We cannot read its cross-origin storage or recover its saves. See the <a href="/privacy-policy#azeroth-survivors-guides">game-window privacy notice</a>.</p></section>
<section id="loading"><h2>If loading takes a long time</h2><p>The first world-data preparation can continue after the outer window reports that it loaded. Watch the progress inside the game. Hiding and restoring the window preserves the current frame; repeatedly reloading starts a new page session.</p><p>If it stalls, try {ext(GAME,'the same hosted game in its own tab')}. If that provider is unavailable, use {ext('https://wow.aethus.pl/','Aethus’s original game')}; it is a separate host, so this session does not automatically follow. Our <a href="{P}mobile/">browser and mobile checks</a> distinguish graphics support from input and storage.</p></section>
<section class="sources" id="sources"><h2>Sources &amp; verification</h2><ol><li id="source-1">{ext('https://azerothsurvivors.online/#play','azerothsurvivors.online · Play entry')} and its game host {ext(GAME,'s.the-false-sun.com')}. Source relationship checked 31 October 2026. Independent third-party hosting; exact parity with the original, distribution permission and long-term availability not verified. Screenshot above records only the displayed client, not a completed run.</li><li id="source-2">{ext('https://wow.aethus.pl/','Aethus · original Azeroth Survivors')}. Original launcher and top-level-only behavior checked 30–31 October 2026; this embedded address is a different provider.</li></ol><a href="#guide">Back to play ↑</a></section>
<section class="related"><h2>Plan your next choice</h2><a href="{P}beginners-guide/">Original-game first run →</a><a href="{P}builds/">Class build routes →</a><a href="{P}save-backup/">Keep a save backup →</a></section></article>'''
    html = shell(P+'play/', 'Play Azeroth Survivors Online | Megabonk.org', 'Play a third-party Azeroth Survivors browser build, expand or hide the game, and find the original host, save precautions and more playable games.', body)
    return P+'play/', stylesheet(html).replace('class="az guide-layout"','class="az guide-layout ps-play-page"',1).replace('</head>','<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/poke-survivor/play.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/azeroth-survivors/play.css"><script defer src="/assets/azeroth-survivors/play.js"></script></head>',1)
